          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela mlavyadzi-sadaka achiona hiro dowa ra koga tarikagota kpwenye nguwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi, andalagiza nguwo iyo ifulwe na kuikpwa kanda kpwa muda wanjina wa siku sabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andachunguza nguwo iyo bada ya kufulwa. Ichikala dowa hiro taridzangbwegaluka rangiye hata dzagbwe tarikagota, phahi, nguwo iyo ni najisi nayo ni iochwe, ikale dowa hiro ri ndani au kondze ya nguwo hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho mlavyadzi-sadaka andaona kukala hiro dowa rinayaya bada ya kufulwa, phahi andakata iyo seemu iriyo na aina ya koga igotayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu, ichikala hiro dowa rindaonekana tsona kpwenye nguwo yofumwa, yosukpwa au kpwenye chitu chochosi cha chingo, phahi inakoga inayogota. Kpwa hivyo nguwo iyo andaiocha. ",
          "type": "text",
